<CustomField xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <fullName>Header_Bottom_Margin__c</fullName>
    <description>Stacked header style only: the gap between the header (its last part: body, tags or footer) and the first field, as an SLDS margin size. Blank is medium (1rem). Unrestricted so values added in later releases save in upgraded orgs.</description>
    <inlineHelpText>Stacked header only: the space under the header before the first field. Blank is medium; none removes the gap.</inlineHelpText>
    <label>Header Bottom Margin</label>
    <required>false</required>
